OL,4,CIn a year of AI solving maths          
OL,5,Cproblems, Anthropic may have just      
OL,6,Csolved the biggest                     
OL,7,GAn Anthropic employee and              
OL,8,Gmathematician claims to have used the  
OL,9,Gcompany's artificial intelligence (AI) 
OL,10,Gchatbot to prove the famed Riemann     
OL,11,Ghypothesis.                            
OL,13,FLevent Alpoge said on Friday, a day    
OL,14,Fafter Anthropic made its US stock      
OL,15,Fmarket debut, that over the course of  
OL,16,Fabout six weeks, he used the Claude    
OL,17,Fchatbot to create a detailed proof of  
OL,18,Fthe maths problem.                     
